stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> MONITORING: System starts

  MONITORING --> CALCULATING: New block detected
  CALCULATING --> SIMULATING: Profitable path found
  CALCULATING --> MONITORING: No opportunity

  SIMULATING --> SUBMITTING: Simulation passes
  SIMULATING --> MONITORING: Simulation fails

  SUBMITTING --> CONFIRMING: Bundle submitted
  SUBMITTING --> MONITORING: Submission rejected

  CONFIRMING --> RECONCILING: Block confirmed
  CONFIRMING --> MONITORING: Bundle not included

  RECONCILING --> PROFIT: P&L > 0
  RECONCILING --> LOSS: P&L < 0
  RECONCILING --> REVERTED: Tx reverted

  PROFIT --> MONITORING: Continue
  LOSS --> MONITORING: Continue
  REVERTED --> MONITORING: Continue

  note right of MONITORING
    Kill-switch can trigger
    from ANY non-terminal state
  end note

  MONITORING --> ABORTED: Kill-switch ARMED
  CALCULATING --> ABORTED: Kill-switch ARMED
  SIMULATING --> ABORTED: Kill-switch ARMED
  SUBMITTING --> ABORTED: Kill-switch ARMED
  CONFIRMING --> ABORTED: Kill-switch ARMED

  ABORTED --> [*]: System shutdown

  note left of ABORTED
    Paper mode: no capital lost
    Audit log: reason + timestamp
    Operator notified
  end note
